{"unit_id":"HRuiCcc__RuiC-dsh-purge#card-zh","repo":"HRuiCcc/RuiC-dsh-purge","commit":"7fc595b957dcf567f5431ee09769a03a2baa253c","type":"card","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:8-80","lib/engine.js:22-86","lib/engine.js:124-240","client.js:71-143"],"text":"RuiC DSH Purge 是面向 DSH 的本机插件，提供聊天命令、模型工具和设置面板，用于检查宿主补丁状态、预览匹配结果并管理提示词。它先识别本机 DSH 安装与兼容配置，再显示可应用的目标和前后哈希；应用前保存快照，逐文件写入并记录阶段，随后可列出快照并在内容未冲突时回滚。设置面板还可独立编辑和保存会话提示词。适合需要查看、调整 DSH 提示词或维护解包宿主文件的用户。无需 API 密钥或外部账号；宿主补丁写入需指定可写的解包安装，操作后需手动重启 DSH。"}
{"unit_id":"HRuiCcc__RuiC-dsh-purge#card-en","repo":"HRuiCcc/RuiC-dsh-purge","commit":"7fc595b957dcf567f5431ee09769a03a2baa253c","type":"card","lang":"en","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:8-80","lib/engine.js:22-86","lib/engine.js:124-240","client.js:71-143"],"text":"RuiC DSH Purge manages DSH patches and a separate prompt. It previews matches and hashes, saves snapshots, and supports conflict-checked rollback. Use its settings panel, chat commands, model tools, or CLI. No API key is needed. Host changes require an unpacked installation and manual restart."}
